      <p class="ho-pl-row__body">Philadelphia has one of the largest stocks of older single-pane rowhome glass in the Northeast — glass that loses heat fast in winter and lets in solar gain in summer. Huper Optik Therm-X is a low-emissivity film engineered for exactly this scenario, adding an insulating layer that improves year-round thermal performance without replacing the window.</p>
      <p class="ho-pl-row__body">Available in TX30 (30% VLT), TX50 (52% VLT), and TX70 (70% VLT), Therm-X gives Philadelphia homeowners a choice between privacy level and light transmission while still getting the Zone 4A climate performance Huper Optik engineered the series for.</p>

