      <p class="ho-pl-row__body">Shield is Huper Optik's safety and security film — designed to help retain glass fragments after impact and delay forced entry. For Philadelphia schools, government buildings, museums, and street-level retail facing smash-and-grab risk, Shield provides a discreet passive layer that works around the clock without changing the look of the glass.</p>
      <p class="ho-pl-row__body">Unlike solar control films, Shield's primary function is structural glass integrity. It can be combined with Huper Optik solar or decorative film for a layered specification — security and solar management on the same glass. The <a href="/benefits/safety-and-security/" class="ho-body-link">safety and security benefits</a> apply equally to residential and commercial properties.</p>

